+### Stage 7 — WEIGH (`Q32`–`Q38`)
+
+| ID | Purpose | Verdict | Code computes / enforces | LLM decides | Smallest LLM output | Trigger predicate | Failure, downgrade, or transition | Grounding |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
